{"1":{"w":[{"c":"يُسَبِّحُ","d":"yusabbiḥu","e":"Glorifies"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"whatever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"السَّمَاوَاتِ","d":"l-samāwāti","e":"the heavens"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and whatever"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"(is) in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the earth"},{"c":"الْمَلِكِ","d":"l-maliki","e":"the Sovereign"},{"c":"الْقُدُّوسِ","d":"l-qudūsi","e":"the Holy"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزِ","d":"l-ʿazīzi","e":"the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمِ","d":"l-ḥakīmi","e":"the All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth is exalting Allah, the Sovereign, the Pure, the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"هُوَ","d":"huwa","e":"He"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"(is) the One Who"},{"c":"بَعَثَ","d":"baʿatha","e":"sent"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"among"},{"c":"الْأُمِّيِّينَ","d":"l-umiyīna","e":"the unlettered"},{"c":"رَسُولًا","d":"rasūlan","e":"a Messenger"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"from themselves"},{"c":"يَتْلُوا","d":"yatlū","e":"reciting"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"to them"},{"c":"ءَايَاتِهِ","d":"āyātihi","e":"His Verses"},{"c":"وَيُزَكِّيهِمْ","d":"wayuzakkīhim","e":"and purifying them"},{"c":"وَيُعَلِّمُهُمُ","d":"wayuʿallimuhumu","e":"and teaching them"},{"c":"الْكِتَابَ","d":"l-kitāba","e":"the Book"},{"c":"وَالْحِكْمَةَ","d":"wal-ḥik'mata","e":"and the wisdom"},{"c":"وَإِنْ","d":"wa-in","e":"although"},{"c":"كَانُوا","d":"kānū","e":"they were"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"قَبْلُ","d":"qablu","e":"before"},{"c":"لَفِي","d":"lafī","e":"surely in"},{"c":"ضَلَالٍ","d":"ḍalālin","e":"an error"},{"c":"مُبِينٍ","d":"mubīnin","e":"clear"}],"a":{"g":"It is He who has sent among the unlettered a Messenger from themselves reciting to them His verses and purifying them and teaching them the Book and wisdom - although they were before in clear error -"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَءَاخَرِينَ","d":"waākharīna","e":"And others"},{"c":"مِنْهُمْ","d":"min'hum","e":"among them"},{"c":"لَمَّا","d":"lammā","e":"who have not yet"},{"c":"يَلْحَقُوا","d":"yalḥaqū","e":"joined"},{"c":"بِهِمْ","d":"bihim","e":"them"},{"c":"وَهُوَ","d":"wahuwa","e":"and He"},{"c":"الْعَزِيزُ","d":"l-ʿazīzu","e":"(is) the All-Mighty"},{"c":"الْحَكِيمُ","d":"l-ḥakīmu","e":"the All-Wise"}],"a":{"g":"And [to] others of them who have not yet joined them. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise."}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"ذَلِكَ","d":"dhālika","e":"That"},{"c":"فَضْلُ","d":"faḍlu","e":"(is the) Bounty"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"يُؤْتِيهِ","d":"yu'tīhi","e":"He gives it"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"(to) whom"},{"c":"يَشَاءُ","d":"yashāu","e":"He wills"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"ذُو","d":"dhū","e":"(is the) Possessor"},{"c":"الْفَضْلِ","d":"l-faḍli","e":"(of) Bounty"},{"c":"الْعَظِيمِ","d":"l-ʿaẓīmi","e":"the Great"}],"a":{"g":"That is the bounty of Allah, which He gives to whom He wills, and Allah is the possessor of great bounty."}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"مَثَلُ","d":"mathalu","e":"(The) likeness"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(of) those who"},{"c":"حُمِّلُوا","d":"ḥummilū","e":"were entrusted"},{"c":"التَّوْرَاةَ","d":"l-tawrāta","e":"(with) the Taurat"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"then"},{"c":"لَمْ","d":"lam","e":"not"},{"c":"يَحْمِلُوهَا","d":"yaḥmilūhā","e":"they bore it"},{"c":"كَمَثَلِ","d":"kamathali","e":"(is) like"},{"c":"الْحِمَارِ","d":"l-ḥimāri","e":"the donkey"},{"c":"يَحْمِلُ","d":"yaḥmilu","e":"who carries"},{"c":"أَسْفَارًا","d":"asfāran","e":"books"},{"c":"بِئْسَ","d":"bi'sa","e":"Wretched is"},{"c":"مَثَلُ","d":"mathalu","e":"(the) example"},{"c":"الْقَوْمِ","d":"l-qawmi","e":"(of) the people"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"who"},{"c":"كَذَّبُوا","d":"kadhabū","e":"deny"},{"c":"بِءَايَاتِ","d":"biāyāti","e":"(the) Signs"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"لَا","d":"lā","e":"(does) not"},{"c":"يَهْدِي","d":"yahdī","e":"guide"},{"c":"الْقَوْمَ","d":"l-qawma","e":"the people"},{"c":"الظَّالِمِينَ","d":"l-ẓālimīna","e":"the wrongdoers"}],"a":{"g":"The example of those who were entrusted with the Torah and then did not take it on is like that of a donkey who carries volumes [of books]. Wretched is the example of the people who deny the signs of Allah. And Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people."}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"you (who)"},{"c":"هَادُوا","d":"hādū","e":"(are) Jews"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"If"},{"c":"زَعَمْتُمْ","d":"zaʿamtum","e":"you claim"},{"c":"أَنَّكُمْ","d":"annakum","e":"that you"},{"c":"أَوْلِيَاءُ","d":"awliyāu","e":"(are) allies"},{"c":"لِلَّهِ","d":"lillahi","e":"of Allah"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"دُونِ","d":"dūni","e":"excluding"},{"c":"النَّاسِ","d":"l-nāsi","e":"the people"},{"c":"فَتَمَنَّوُا","d":"fatamannawū","e":"then wish"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَ","d":"l-mawta","e":"(for) the death"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you are"},{"c":"صَادِقِينَ","d":"ṣādiqīna","e":"truthful"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"O you who are Jews, if you claim that you are allies of Allah, excluding the [other] people, then wish for death, if you should be truthful.\""}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"But not"},{"c":"يَتَمَنَّوْنَهُ","d":"yatamannawnahu","e":"they will wish for it"},{"c":"أَبَدًا","d":"abadan","e":"ever"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"for what"},{"c":"قَدَّمَتْ","d":"qaddamat","e":"have sent forth"},{"c":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","d":"aydīhim","e":"their hands"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"عَلِيمٌ","d":"ʿalīmun","e":"(is) All-Knowing"},{"c":"بِالظَّالِمِينَ","d":"bil-ẓālimīna","e":"of the wrongdoers"}],"a":{"g":"But they will not wish for it, ever, because of what their hands have put forth. And Allah is Knowing of the wrongdoers."}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"إِنَّ","d":"inna","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"الْمَوْتَ","d":"l-mawta","e":"the death"},{"c":"الَّذِي","d":"alladhī","e":"which"},{"c":"تَفِرُّونَ","d":"tafirrūna","e":"you flee"},{"c":"مِنْهُ","d":"min'hu","e":"from it"},{"c":"فَإِنَّهُ","d":"fa-innahu","e":"then surely it"},{"c":"مُلَاقِيكُمْ","d":"mulāqīkum","e":"(will) meet you"},{"c":"ثُمَّ","d":"thumma","e":"Then"},{"c":"تُرَدُّونَ","d":"turaddūna","e":"you will be sent back"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"عَالِمِ","d":"ʿālimi","e":"(the) All-Knower"},{"c":"الْغَيْبِ","d":"l-ghaybi","e":"(of) the unseen"},{"c":"وَالشَّهَادَةِ","d":"wal-shahādati","e":"and the witnessed"},{"c":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُمْ","d":"fayunabbi-ukum","e":"and He will inform you"},{"c":"بِمَا","d":"bimā","e":"of what"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you used (to)"},{"c":"تَعْمَلُونَ","d":"taʿmalūna","e":"do"}],"a":{"g":"Say, \"Indeed, the death from which you flee - indeed, it will meet you. Then you will be returned to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you about what you used to do.\""}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"يَاأَيُّهَا","d":"yāayyuhā","e":"O"},{"c":"الَّذِينَ","d":"alladhīna","e":"(you) who"},{"c":"ءَامَنُوا","d":"āmanū","e":"believe"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"When"},{"c":"نُودِيَ","d":"nūdiya","e":"(the) call is made"},{"c":"لِلصَّلَوةِ","d":"lilṣṣalati","e":"for (the) prayer"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"on"},{"c":"يَوْمِ","d":"yawmi","e":"(the) day"},{"c":"الْجُمُعَةِ","d":"l-jumuʿati","e":"(of) Friday"},{"c":"فَاسْعَوْا","d":"fa-is'ʿaw","e":"then hasten"},{"c":"إِلَى","d":"ilā","e":"to"},{"c":"ذِكْرِ","d":"dhik'ri","e":"(the) remembrance"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَذَرُوا","d":"wadharū","e":"and leave"},{"c":"الْبَيْعَ","d":"l-bayʿa","e":"the business"},{"c":"ذَلِكُمْ","d":"dhālikum","e":"That"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"لَكُمْ","d":"lakum","e":"for you"},{"c":"إِنْ","d":"in","e":"if"},{"c":"كُنْتُمْ","d":"kuntum","e":"you"},{"c":"تَعْلَمُونَ","d":"taʿlamūna","e":"know"}],"a":{"g":"O you who have believed, when [the adhan] is called for the prayer on the day of Jumu'ah [Friday], then proceed to the remembrance of Allah and leave trade. That is better for you, if you only knew."}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"فَإِذَا","d":"fa-idhā","e":"Then when"},{"c":"قُضِيَتِ","d":"quḍiyati","e":"is concluded"},{"c":"الصَّلَوةُ","d":"l-ṣalatu","e":"the prayer"},{"c":"فَانْتَشِرُوا","d":"fa-intashirū","e":"then disperse"},{"c":"فِي","d":"fī","e":"in"},{"c":"الْأَرْضِ","d":"l-arḍi","e":"the land"},{"c":"وَابْتَغُوا","d":"wa-ib'taghū","e":"and seek"},{"c":"مِنْ","d":"min","e":"from"},{"c":"فَضْلِ","d":"faḍli","e":"(the) Bounty"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَاذْكُرُوا","d":"wa-udh'kurū","e":"and remember"},{"c":"اللَّهَ","d":"l-laha","e":"Allah"},{"c":"كَثِيرًا","d":"kathīran","e":"much"},{"c":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","d":"laʿallakum","e":"so that you may"},{"c":"تُفْلِحُونَ","d":"tuf'liḥūna","e":"succeed"}],"a":{"g":"And when the prayer has been concluded, disperse within the land and seek from the bounty of Allah, and remember Allah often that you may succeed."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"وَإِذَا","d":"wa-idhā","e":"And when"},{"c":"رَأَوْا","d":"ra-aw","e":"they saw"},{"c":"تِجَارَةً","d":"tijāratan","e":"a transaction"},{"c":"أَوْ","d":"aw","e":"or"},{"c":"لَهْوًا","d":"lahwan","e":"a sport"},{"c":"انْفَضُّوا","d":"infaḍḍū","e":"they rushed"},{"c":"إِلَيْهَا","d":"ilayhā","e":"to it"},{"c":"وَتَرَكُوكَ","d":"watarakūka","e":"and left you"},{"c":"قَائِمًا","d":"qāiman","e":"standing"},{"c":"قُلْ","d":"qul","e":"Say"},{"c":"مَا","d":"mā","e":"What"},{"c":"عِنْدَ","d":"ʿinda","e":"(is) with"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"Allah"},{"c":"خَيْرٌ","d":"khayrun","e":"(is) better"},{"c":"مِنَ","d":"mina","e":"than"},{"c":"اللَّهْوِ","d":"l-lahwi","e":"the sport"},{"c":"وَمِنَ","d":"wamina","e":"and from"},{"c":"التِّجَارَةِ","d":"l-tijārati","e":"(any) transaction"},{"c":"وَاللَّهُ","d":"wal-lahu","e":"And Allah"},{"c":"خَيْرُ","d":"khayru","e":"(is the) Best"},{"c":"الرَّازِقِينَ","d":"l-rāziqīna","e":"(of) the Providers"}],"a":{"g":"But when they saw a transaction or a diversion, [O Muhammad], they rushed to it and left you standing. Say, \"What is with Allah is better than diversion and than a transaction, and Allah is the best of providers.\""}}}